"""English content of the AURZANE Big Five personality test (23/11/2026).
Items: original English wording of the International Personality Item Pool (ipip.ori.org), public domain,
in the same order and with the same scoring keys as the Spanish version (personalidad_es/datos.js):
  I50  = IPIP Big-Five factor markers (Goldberg, 1992); the 20-item version reuses 20 of them (Mini-IPIP, Donnellan et al., 2006).
  I120 = IPIP-NEO-120 (Johnson, 2014). As in the Spanish version, the two political-vote items of the Liberalism facet are replaced
         by two items of the same facet from the IPIP-NEO-300 (criminals and help; tax money for artists)."""

